{"id":"d2607dfa48c40f32","group":"93","path":"93/93-lem-zorn-filter.md","title":"Zorn Filter","display":"Zorn Filter","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-lem-zorn-filter","aliases":["93-lem-zorn-filter"],"display":"Zorn Filter","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-ultrafilter]]","[[93-ax-filter-zorn]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-lem-zorn-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-lem-zorn-filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Zorn Filter"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fc989d8f8938c283\" href=\"?note=fc989d8f8938c283\" title=\"93-df-ultrafilter\">93-df-ultrafilter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8438c6ecfb48c83f\" href=\"?note=8438c6ecfb48c83f\" title=\"93-ax-filter-zorn\">93-ax-filter-zorn</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"lem-zorn-filter---Zorn-Filter\">lem-zorn-filter - Zorn Filter</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{A}\">\\(\\mathbf{A}\\)</span> is a Boolean algebra and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> is a proper filter on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{A}\">\\(\\mathbf{A}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProperFil}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProperFil}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}\\)</span> are the predicates of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fc989d8f8938c283\" href=\"?note=fc989d8f8938c283\" title=\"93-df-ultrafilter\">93-df-ultrafilter</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProperFil}_{93}(F,\\mathbf{A})\\to \\exists U(F\\subseteq U\\land \\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}(U,\\mathbf{A})).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ProperFil}_{93}(F,\\mathbf{A})\\to \\exists U(F\\subseteq U\\land \\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}(U,\\mathbf{A})).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Zorn's lemma supplies maximal proper filters, hence ultrafilters in Boolean algebras.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"lem-zorn-filter---Zorn-Filter","text":"lem-zorn-filter - Zorn Filter","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"fc989d8f8938c283","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-ax-filter-zorn","status":"resolved","id":"8438c6ecfb48c83f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-ax-filter-zorn]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"fc989d8f8938c283","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ProperFil}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-ultrafilter]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf{A}","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProperFil}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProperFil}_{93}(F,\\mathbf{A})\\to \\exists U(F\\subseteq U\\land \\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}(U,\\mathbf{A})).","display":true}],"bytes":751